<title>UK: Lehman sets capped warrants on D.Telecom.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets capped warrants on D.Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance S.A. has issued five million &quot;Discoun-T Certificates' on Deutsche Telekom AG, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>The certificates are priced at 27.90 DEM based on a reference price of 32.0 DEM. The certificates will expire on July 30, 1999  when the investor can receive in marks an amount equal to the stock price of Deutsche Telekom AG but not more than a 42.0 DEM cap.</p>
<p>There is a payment date of December 02, 1996 a minimum exercise of 100 certificates and listing will be in Frankfurt, Stuttgart and Dusseldorf.</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
